        {
          "es": "Y sobre sus anillos duerme el dios Vishnu, el protector del mundo, con su esposa Lakshmi a sus pies.",
          "en": "And on its coils sleeps the god Vishnu, the protector of the world, with his wife Lakshmi at his feet."
        },
