      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "En el Bhagavad Gita, uno de los libros hindúes más queridos, Vishnu, en la forma de Krishna, lo dice así:",
          "en": "In the Bhagavad Gita, one of the most loved Hindu books, Vishnu, in the form of Krishna, says it himself:"
        },
        {
          "es": "\"Cada vez que la bondad decae y el mal crece, yo vengo al mundo, era tras era.\"",
          "en": "\"Whenever goodness declines and evil rises, I come into the world, age after age.\""
        },
        {
          "es": "Esas bajadas se llaman avatares. Sí: de ahí viene la palabra.",
          "en": "These descents are called avatars. Yes, that is where the word comes from."
        },
        {
          "es": "Esta temporada vas a conocer algunos: un pez gigante, una tortuga, un hombre león y un niño de pasos enormes.",
          "en": "This season you will meet some: a giant fish, a tortoise, a man-lion and a boy who takes huge steps."
        }
